{"id": "moses-lake-capstone", "category": "Special Projects", "title": "Moses Lake Capstone Project", "subtitle": "Digital twin, simulation, and AI decision support for returnable containers.", "cover": {"src": "/assets/experience/cover-moses-lake-capstone.png", "width": 164, "height": 136, "fit": "contain", "background": "#0d0d11", "srcset": ""}, "html": "<div class=\"note-resources\"><a href=\"https://mobius-capstone-aim3nxv8wdviukvqvw32st.streamlit.app/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open supply chain inventory tracking model<span aria-hidden=\"true\"> ↗</span></a></div><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>From container tracking to asset-allocation decisions</h3><p>From January to May 2026, our team worked in a Supply Chain Project Consultant (Capstone) capacity on a project with Moses Lake Industries, developing an AI decision-support prototype for returnable drums and totes.</p><p>Without adding RFID or GPS hardware, the project combined a digital twin, simulation, and operations research methods to explore allocation under demand uncertainty, improve asset utilization, and reduce stockout risk.</p></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>Testing demand and logistics changes with what-if simulation</h3><p>The dashboard brings cumulative shipments, an EWMA trend forecast, and daily shipment volume by product into one interface, alongside scenario controls for demand changes and logistics delays. Users can compare assumptions against transit and asset-cycle metrics to inform allocation decisions.</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-what-if-overview.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-what-if-overview.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/moses-lake-what-if-overview-d891eb198072-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/moses-lake-what-if-overview-d891eb198072-843.webp 843w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"What-if simulation interface for demand and logistics delays, showing cumulative shipments, an EWMA trend, and daily volume by product.\" width=\"843\" height=\"575\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>What-if simulation interface for demand and logistics delays, showing cumulative shipments, an EWMA trend, and daily volume by product.</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>Connecting each container’s journey through its serial number</h3><p>The serial-level view separates the asset loop into inventory, outbound transit, time at the customer, and return transit, with manufacture dates, loop progress, and expected return timing. A registry provides product, customer, status, and project-defined compliance filters, connecting individual-container detail to the broader asset pool.</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-serial-detail.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-serial-detail.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/moses-lake-serial-detail-1d88c7d0ee28-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/moses-lake-serial-detail-1d88c7d0ee28-840.webp 840w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"Serial-level container detail showing customer, manufacture date, loop stages, and expected return timing.\" width=\"840\" height=\"419\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Serial-level container detail showing customer, manufacture date, loop stages, and expected return timing.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-return-status.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-return-status.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/moses-lake-return-status-487242a09b85-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/moses-lake-return-status-487242a09b85-845.webp 845w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"Returnable-container status summary and serial registry with status, product, customer, and compliance filters.\" width=\"845\" height=\"438\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Returnable-container status summary and serial registry with status, product, customer, and compliance filters.</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>Linking customer dwell time to fleet-wide flows</h3><p>Customer-level micro-simulation compares demand, observed dwell time, and documented loop time, then projects container availability over time for a specified allocation. This supports examining each customer’s demand and return cycle when planning capacity.</p><p>A Sankey diagram visualizes the asset pool, project-defined compliance categories, and flows between available, in-transit, and customer-held assets. Compliance indicators reflect prototype configuration rather than a legal determination.</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-customer-simulation.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-customer-simulation.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/moses-lake-customer-simulation-16bf90be82f3-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/moses-lake-customer-simulation-16bf90be82f3-845.webp 845w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"Customer-level demand and dwell-time analysis with an availability simulation for a dedicated container allocation.\" width=\"845\" height=\"367\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Customer-level demand and dwell-time analysis with an availability simulation for a dedicated container allocation.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-fleet-lifecycle.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-fleet-lifecycle.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/moses-lake-fleet-lifecycle-5940de82bf5a-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/moses-lake-fleet-lifecycle-5940de82bf5a-849.webp 849w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"Sankey view of the asset lifecycle; compliance labels reflect project conditions configured in the prototype.\" width=\"849\" height=\"555\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Sankey view of the asset lifecycle; compliance labels reflect project conditions configured in the prototype.</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>Adding AI to scenario analysis</h3><p>Our team integrated AI decision support through an API so users could ask natural-language questions about demand, logistics, and policy changes. The screenshots use a hypothetical 20% export tariff to demonstrate recommendations for further simulation, customer outreach, and asset redeployment based on the dashboard snapshot.</p><p>These are prototype scenario-analysis outputs. The responses do not establish that simulations were completed, recommendations were executed, or policy impacts were validated.</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-ai-recommendations.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-ai-recommendations.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/moses-lake-ai-recommendations-1091a5beb841-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/moses-lake-ai-recommendations-1091a5beb841-838.webp 838w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"Prototype AI output proposing simulations and allocation responses to a hypothetical tariff scenario.\" width=\"838\" height=\"532\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Prototype AI output proposing simulations and allocation responses to a hypothetical tariff scenario.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-ai-scenario-chat.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-ai-scenario-chat.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/moses-lake-ai-scenario-chat-fb4fe5c9f3bf-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/moses-lake-ai-scenario-chat-fb4fe5c9f3bf-846.webp 846w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"AI conversation prompted with a hypothetical 20% export tariff; this is not evidence of an actual policy or a completed impact estimate.\" width=\"846\" height=\"537\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>AI conversation prompted with a hypothetical 20% export tariff; this is not evidence of an actual policy or a completed impact estimate.</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>Technical implementation and modeled outcomes</h3><p>The technical work included Python and SQL data processing, ETL pipelines, and a modular architecture, bringing the digital twin, simulation, and AI decision support into a demonstrable prototype.</p><p>The project model estimated approximately 5% in potential working-capital savings (about $1.5M), with improved asset utilization and service reliability in simulation. These are modeled and simulated outcomes, rather than verified financial savings realized by the company.</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-simulation-dashboard.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-simulation-dashboard.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/moses-lake-simulation-dashboard-361b7c8eb010-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/moses-lake-simulation-dashboard-361b7c8eb010-838.webp 838w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"Additional what-if dashboard screenshot preserving the overall view of demand, logistics, and asset-cycle metrics.\" width=\"838\" height=\"577\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Additional what-if dashboard screenshot preserving the overall view of demand, logistics, and asset-cycle metrics.</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>Teamwork and the public showcase</h3><p>This project would not have been possible without our team’s collaboration. Thank you to every teammate for your contributions and to our professors for their guidance and support. From our meetings to the business school’s public showcase, this was a shared achievement.</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-team-meeting.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-team-meeting.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/moses-lake-team-meeting-947f48550e25-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/moses-lake-team-meeting-947f48550e25-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"An online collaboration meeting for the Moses Lake Capstone Project.\" width=\"2802\" height=\"1544\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>An online collaboration meeting for the Moses Lake Capstone Project.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-business-school-showcase.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/moses-lake-business-school-showcase.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/moses-lake-business-school-showcase-c144f9483a12-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/moses-lake-business-school-showcase-c144f9483a12-748.webp 748w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"The team presenting the Moses Lake Capstone Project at the business school’s public showcase.\" width=\"748\" height=\"577\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>The team presenting the Moses Lake Capstone Project at the business school’s public showcase.</figcaption></figure></div></section><p class=\"case-note\">The system-interface screenshots show the project prototype and simulations.</p>", "status": "published", "pending": "Full article coming soon.", "close": "Close"}